# Build artifacts — the deployable inputs are handler.kz's OUTPUT (wasm/) plus
# the adapter in api/. Everything the Koru compiler leaves behind stays out.
#
# The local-proof harnesses are anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an
# unanchored `serve.mjs` matches at ANY depth, which silently excluded
# api/serve.mjs and failed the deploy with "doesn't match any Serverless
# Functions inside the api directory".
*.zig
a.out
zig-out/
.zig-cache/
program.ast.json
/serve.mjs
/test-adapter.mjs
